[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16443.07, "timestamp": "04:34:03", "text": "主要是如果……如果不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16446.709, "timestamp": "04:34:06", "text": "呃，易燃，而且如果它不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16450.789, "timestamp": "04:34:10", "text": "我认为携带新鲜食物是可以的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16454.47, "timestamp": "04:34:14", "text": "我对此了解不多，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16458.869, "timestamp": "04:34:18", "text": "他们对我没有意见。所以，我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16461.109, "timestamp": "04:34:21", "text": "带了一些香料和零食，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16465.189, "timestamp": "04:34:25", "text": "我还带了衣服和枕头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16467.269, "timestamp": "04:34:27", "text": "在家办公。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16469.67, "timestamp": "04:34:29", "text": "鞋子之类的东西呢？多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16471.99, "timestamp": "04:34:31", "text": "你拍了很多？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16474.67, "timestamp": "04:34:34", "text": "鞋。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16478.99, "timestamp": "04:34:38", "text": "拿了一、二，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16482.07, "timestamp": "04:34:42", "text": "三，二。哦，是的。两双。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16486.551, "timestamp": "04:34:46", "text": "两三双鞋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16488.39, "timestamp": "04:34:48", "text": "那么，关于衣服，你用了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16490.551, "timestamp": "04:34:50", "text": "真空封口机？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16494.629, "timestamp": "04:34:54", "text": "呃，不，我没有。我只是喜欢打包"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16497.109, "timestamp": "04:34:57", "text": "它们非常紧"}]